A '''Time Gun''' can be used on {{Item|Youngite}} ore to turn it into {{Item|Timite}} ore and on {{Item|Timite}} ore to turn it into {{Item|Obsolite}} ore. This process is referred to as ''Wackifying'' in the item's ability description and each stage takes {{green|2}} seconds.

